    "mathematics": "AA gives triangles ABD~AEC and ABD~CED with correspondences (A,B,D)<->(A,E,C) and (A,B,D)<->(C,E,D). Thus AB*AC=AD*AE and AD*DE=BD*DC. Since AE=AD+DE, AB*AC=AD^2+BD*DC, so AD^2=AB*AC-BD*DC; AD>0 selects the positive square root."
